{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Until Dusk Fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Dusk Fall\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>story-driven survival horror game</strong> presented through an <strong>isometric perspective</strong>. <br>You play as a man in world called <strong>Mosus</strong>, who wakes up one morning to find <br>that the world has changed  and the sunlight is gone forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/extras/e699d62a476b7101c723708c306c2efd.avif?t=1770313823\" width=152 height=539 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As monstrous creatures</strong> begin to consume everything around him, haunting visions slowly reveal a truth he was never meant to know. You must survive amidst the inexplicable darkness and uncover what truly happened to this mysterious world and its <strong>strange people</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/extras/e25059bf5f5e447ff3de63fdc1d3f911.poster.avif?t=1770313823\" width=800 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/extras/e25059bf5f5e447ff3de63fdc1d3f911.webm?t=1770313823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/extras/e25059bf5f5e447ff3de63fdc1d3f911.mp4?t=1770313823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will encounter <strong>supernatural events</strong>, <br><strong>mysterious puzzles</strong>, and <strong>fragments of memory</strong> that may connect to his forgotten past. <br>Follow his path through the silence, and discover the truth behind the world where the light has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/extras/e92182f71887f69413ea30dd935cf81c.avif?t=1770313823\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152040?t=1770313823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152040?t=1770313823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/48e5b327d0132a3fee83646c3fee2fc8ee7f0b51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770313823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152040/48e5b327d0132a3fee83646c3fee2fc8ee7f0b51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770313823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages. It features frequent violence and blood consistent with the survival horror genre. Players will encounter monstrous creatures and combat situations where characters can be injured or killed, accompanied by blood effects and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":4152700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Until Dusk Fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Dusk Fall\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>story-driven survival horror game</strong> presented through an <strong>isometric perspective</strong>. <br>You play as a man in world called <strong>Mosus</strong>, who wakes up one morning to find <br>th